{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Driving Rogue\u00a0</strong></i>plunges you into a <i>high-speed rogue-like</i> challenge where every race is a fight for survival and mastery. Navigate treacherous city streets, execute precise manoeuvres, and <strong>beat  high scores</strong> to reach the very top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, slipstream, near miss, drift</strong>, and <i>upgrade</i> your car to dominate the roads. Master the art of precision driving to finish each level with both style and speed, unlocking potent upgrades, fresh challenges, and new vehicles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race, visit the <strong>shop</strong> to grab new mods or unlock special abilities. Every run is procedurally generated - no two races are ever the same. Build your strategy, modify your car, and push for the longest streak you can. How far will your build take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/e5a842c142612e7817a930001c0533c5.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/e5a842c142612e7817a930001c0533c5.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garage with a lineup of <strong>unique cars</strong> \u2014 each with its own handling and flair.\u00a0Personalise your ride with striking vinyls and stand out on every road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ec231478e0f2b5b35993574e213a3976.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ec231478e0f2b5b35993574e213a3976.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Biomes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride through diverse biomes, from neon-lit cities at night to winding countryside roads filled with iconic vehicles and roadside hazards you\u2019ll want to spot\u2026 and avoid. Each environment comes alive with a varied soundtrack that matches the game\u2019s nocturnal, adrenaline-fueled vibe. There\u2019s always something new to discover and a fresh challenge around every curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the perfect run across a neon-fueled world. Beat your high scores, unlock new cars, collect achievements, and refine your strategy with every attempt. With diverse, upbeat tracks and a stylish, glowing world, drifting has never felt this smooth or addictive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088700?t=1772040096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088700?t=1772040096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/fb62d0b2a0c999ddec1200894b8bb96a33171bde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772040096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/fb62d0b2a0c999ddec1200894b8bb96a33171bde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772040096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4291930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Driving Rogue\u00a0</strong></i>plunges you into a <i>high-speed rogue-like</i> challenge where every race is a fight for survival and mastery. Navigate treacherous city streets, execute precise manoeuvres, and <strong>beat  high scores</strong> to reach the very top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/15d0d694893a72153ab4055500a7ca49.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, slipstream, near miss, drift</strong>, and <i>upgrade</i> your car to dominate the roads. Master the art of precision driving to finish each level with both style and speed, unlocking potent upgrades, fresh challenges, and new vehicles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a663c3910bb25d2959044e0548615b8c.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelike System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each race, visit the <strong>shop</strong> to grab new mods or unlock special abilities. Every run is procedurally generated - no two races are ever the same. Build your strategy, modify your car, and push for the longest streak you can. How far will your build take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/e5a842c142612e7817a930001c0533c5.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/e5a842c142612e7817a930001c0533c5.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garage with a lineup of <strong>unique cars</strong> \u2014 each with its own handling and flair.\u00a0Personalise your ride with striking vinyls and stand out on every road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ec231478e0f2b5b35993574e213a3976.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ec231478e0f2b5b35993574e213a3976.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Biomes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride through diverse biomes, from neon-lit cities at night to winding countryside roads filled with iconic vehicles and roadside hazards you\u2019ll want to spot\u2026 and avoid. Each environment comes alive with a varied soundtrack that matches the game\u2019s nocturnal, adrenaline-fueled vibe. There\u2019s always something new to discover and a fresh challenge around every curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.poster.avif?t=1772040096\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.webm?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/81423a2fa6193285b8e80bbc3a6ca041.mp4?t=1772040096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Ending Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the perfect run across a neon-fueled world. Beat your high scores, unlock new cars, collect achievements, and refine your strategy with every attempt. With diverse, upbeat tracks and a stylish, glowing world, drifting has never felt this smooth or addictive.</p>","developers":["Gravity Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/acf04e1a2346a4c78cd5bc4e5ca262da756344cc/header.jpg?t=1772040096","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Gravity Works z o.o. Published under license by Gravity Works Inc. Driving Rogue\u2122 and its associated logos are trademarks of Gravity Works z o.o. Gravity Works\u2122 and the Gravity Works logo are trademarks of Gravity Works Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</str