700/6decae1cd8f1433de14bc1da8eb4c0309da47a44/ss_6decae1cd8f1433de14bc1da8eb4c0309da47a44.600x338.jpg?t=1772040096"}],"short_description":"Arcade driving meets roguelike chaos - fast, intense, and ridiculously addictive. In Driving Rogue, every run is a new story: the city keeps changing, and you\u2019ll need pure focus to push your score to the limit. After each race, hit the shop and craft your build for the longest streak possible.","steam_appid":3088700,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://gravity.blue/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}